Package: wxy
Title: R Bindings for 'wxylib'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A minimal spike of R bindings to the 'wxylib' Rust crates:
    test whether a coordinate vector is regular, build a geotransform
    from an extent and dimension, and warp a matrix to a grid in another
    coordinate reference system, all in pure Rust.
License: Apache License (== 2.0) | MIT + file LICENSE
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc
URL: https://github.com/wxylib/r
BugReports: https://github.com/wxylib/r/issues
